## Generation Parameters Guide


| Parameter | Description | Example |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **`groupId`** | The organizational domain for this project. | com.fcb.mosaic.account |
| **`artifactId`** | The physical name of the project folder and the compiled JAR. | account-profile |
| **`version`** | The starting release version of this service. | 1.0.0-SNAPSHOT |
| **`package`** | The root Java package. Defaults to `groupId` if omitted, but can be overridden. | com.fcb.mosaic.account.profile |
| **`serviceName`** | The base prefix used to generate Class names (e.g., `[Name]Controller`). | AccountProfile |

*(To generate a similar project, use `mvn archetype:generate` with the `fcb.mosaic.archetypes` coordinates and supply the variables above).*
